  "slides": [
    "<section class=\"relative h-[720px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden bg-white flex\" data-slide-title=\"Presenton – Open-Source AI Presentation Generator\" data-slide-type=\"title\">\n<div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center px-20\">\n<h1 class=\"font-syne text-[72px] font-medium leading-[1.06] tracking-[-0.04em] text-black\">\n<span class=\"block\">Free &amp;</span>\n<span class=\"block\">Open Source</span>\n<span class=\"block\">Presentation AI</span>\n</h1>\n<p class=\"mt-4 font-manrope text-[18px] font-medium leading-[26px] tracking-[0.54px] text-black/80 max-w-[500px]\">Generate editable PPTX and PDF presentations with AI. Fully customizable, exportable, and built for teams.</p>\n<div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-4\">\n<a class=\"inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-[14px] bg-[#7A5AF8] px-[30px] font-manrope text-base font-medium text-white hover:bg-[#6847F4] transition-colors\">Get Started</a>\n<a class=\"inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-[14px] border border-[#E1E1E5] bg-white px-[30px] font-manrope text-base font-medium text-[#191919] hover:bg-[#F6F6F9] transition-colors\">Star on GitHub</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex-1 flex items-center justify-center\">\n<img alt=\"Abstract flowing geometric shapes in purple and violet tones\" class=\"w-[600px] h-[450px] rounded-lg shadow-xl\" image-type=\"image\" prompt=\"Abstract flowing geometric shapes in purple and violet tones, soft gradients, fluid curves overlapping, minimalist modern aesthetic, no text no letters no UI elements, high quality digital art\" src=\"https://presenton-public-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/users/6958c0f1-63bd-4057-bf63-4421d4951284/images/d6af2a2e-d73f-4ca4-9bf1-649fe0464d4b.png\"/>\n</div>\n</section>",
    "<section class=\"relative h-[720px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden bg-white flex\" data-slide-title=\"What is Presenton?\" data-slide-type=\"content\">\n<div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center px-20\">\n<h2 class=\"font-syne text-[48px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.03em] text-black mb-6\">AI-Powered Presentation Generator</h2>\n<ul class=\"space-y-4 font-manrope text-lg text-black/80 max-w-[520px]\">\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><img alt=\"AI Icon\" class=\"w-6 h-6 mt-1\" color=\"#7A5AF8\" image-type=\"icon\" query=\"AI\" src=\"https://presenton-public-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/static/icons/bold/robot-bold.svg\"/><span>Generate full presentations from simple prompts or documents using AI.</span></li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><img alt=\"Template Icon\" class=\"w-6 h-6 mt-1\" color=\"#7A5AF8\" image-type=\"icon\" query=\"template\" src=\"https://presenton-public-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/static/icons/bold/blueprint-bold.svg\"/><span>Import your own PPTX templates and retain your brand's identity.</span></li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><img alt=\"Edit Icon\" class=\"w-6 h-6 mt-1\" color=\"#7A5AF8\" image-type=\"icon\" query=\"edit\" src=\"https://presenton-public-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/static/icons/bold/scissors-bold.svg\"/><span>Robust editing tools let you fine-tune every slide before export.</span></li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><img alt=\"Export Icon\" class=\"w-6 h-6 mt-1\" color=\"#7A5AF8\" image-type=\"icon\" query=\"export\" src=\"https://presenton-public-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/static/icons/bold/share-fat-bold.svg\"/><span>Export to PPTX, PDF, or embed with a simple API endpoint.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex-1 flex items-center justify-center\">\n<img alt=\"Abstract purple interconnected nodes and circles\" class=\"w-[550px] h-[400px] rounded-lg shadow-lg\" image-type=\"image\" prompt=\"Abstract data visualization concept with translucent glowing purple circles and interconnected nodes, futuristic technology feel, clean minimal composition, no text no letters no screens, artistic\" src=\"https://presenton-public-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/users/6958c0f1-63bd-4057-bf63-4421d4951284/images/f6922e63-5705-4206-97ea-a0b7c2efe4f3.png\"/>\n</div>\n</section>",
    "<section class=\"relative h-[720px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden bg-[#F6F6F9] flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-16\" data-slide-title=\"Key Features\" data-slide-type=\"content\">\n<h2 class=\"font-syne text-[48px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.03em] text-black mb-12\">Everything You Need for AI Slides</h2>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-8 w-full max-w-[1050px]\">\n<div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm flex flex-col items-start\">\n<img alt=\"AI generation icon\" class=\"w-12 h-12 mb-4\" color=\"#7A5AF8\" image-type=\"icon\" query=\"AI\" src=\"https://presenton-public-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/static/icons/bold/robot-bold.svg\"/>\n<h3 class=\"font-syne text-2xl font-semibold mb-2\">AI Generation</h3>\n<p class=\"font-manrope text-base text-gray-600\">Create presentations from a simple prompt in seconds. Let AI handle structure, content, and design.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm flex flex-col items-start\">\n<img alt=\"template icon\" class=\"w-12 h-12 mb-4\" color=\"#7A5AF8\" image-type=\"icon\" query=\"template\" src=\"https://presenton-public-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/static/icons/bold/blueprint-bold.svg\"/>\n<h3 class=\"font-syne text-2xl font-semibold mb-2\">Template Import</h3>\n<p class=\"font-manrope text-base text-gray-600\">Bring your existing PPTX templates. Presenton adapts AI content to your custom branding.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm flex flex-col items-start\">\n<img alt=\"edit icon\" class=\"w-12 h-12 mb-4\" color=\"#7A5AF8\" image-type=\"icon\" query=\"edit\" src=\"https://presenton-public-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/static/icons/bold/scissors-bold.svg\"/>\n<h3 class=\"font-syne text-2xl font-semibold mb-2\">Robust Editor</h3>\n<p class=\"font-manrope text-base text-gray-600\">Edit text, images, charts, and layouts with a full-featured editor. No design skills needed.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>",
    "<section class=\"relative h-[720px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden bg-white flex items-center justify-center\" data-slide-title=\"Open Source &amp; Community\" data-slide-type=\"content\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-16 max-w-[1000px] mx-auto\">\n<div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center text-center\">\n<img alt=\"GitHub icon\" class=\"w-20 h-20 mb-6\" color=\"#191919\" image-type=\"icon\" query=\"github\" src=\"https://presenton-public-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/static/icons/bold/github-logo-bold.svg\"/>\n<h2 class=\"font-syne text-[48px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.03em] text-black mb-4\">100% Open Source</h2>\n<p class=\"font-manrope text-lg text-gray-600 mb-8 max-w-md\">Presenton is fully open source, licensed under MIT. Host it yourself, contribute, and build the future of AI presentations together.</p>\n<a class=\"inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-[14px] bg-[#7A5AF8] px-[30px] font-manrope text-base font-medium text-white hover:bg-[#6847F4] transition-colors\">Star on GitHub</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex-1\">\n<img alt=\"Abstract glowing purple network globe\" class=\"w-[500px] h-[400px] rounded-lg shadow-xl\" image-type=\"image\" prompt=\"Abstract open source community concept, glowing purple network of connected dots and lines forming a globe-like sphere, dark background, ethereal, no text no letters no code, futuristic\" src=\"https://presenton-public-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/users/6958c0f1-63bd-4057-bf63-4421d4951284/images/ae784f01-53c4-432a-9d42-7a10d061f777.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>",
    "<section class=\"relative h-[720px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden bg-[#191919] flex\" data-slide-title=\"Start Creating\" data-slide-type=\"closing\">\n<div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center px-20\">\n<h2 class=\"font-syne text-[56px] font-medium leading-[1.06] tracking-[-0.04em] text-white mb-6\"><span class=\"text-[#7A5AF8]\">Ready</span> to build your next presentation?</h2>\n<p class=\"font-manrope text-[18px] font-medium leading-[26px] tracking-[0.54px] text-white/80 mb-8 max-w-[500px]\">Join thousands of teams using Presenton to generate beautiful, editable slides in seconds.</p>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n<a class=\"inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-[14px] bg-[#7A5AF8] px-[30px] font-manrope text-base font-medium text-white hover:bg-[#6847F4] transition-colors\">Get Started</a>\n<a class=\"inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-[14px] border border-white/20 bg-transparent px-[30px] font-manrope text-base font-medium text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">Star on GitHub</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex-1 flex items-center justify-center\">\n<img alt=\"Abstract upward flowing purple light streaks\" class=\"w-[600px] h-[450px] rounded-lg shadow-2xl\" image-type=\"image\" prompt=\"Abstract upward flowing purple and indigo light streaks on dark background, sense of motion and progress, elegant minimalist, no text no letters no objects, atmospheric gradient\" src=\"https://presenton-public-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/users/6958c0f1-63bd-4057-bf63-4421d4951284/images/772e9959-1f35-4cf2-96dd-020e04a21343.png\"/>\n</div>\n</section>"
